@startuml ui_wireframe
title Unified Software Manager Panel Wireframe & State Diagram

' ===========================
' 1. Panel Layout Wireframe
' ===========================
rectangle "Software Manager Panel" {
  == Status & Version ==
  [Status: Offroad \| current fork [branch]]
  [Version: vX.Y.Z]  [Branch ▶]  [CHECK/DOWNLOAD]  [INSTALL]  [UNINSTALL]

  == Profile Management ==
  [Profile ▶]  [Select]  [Backup]  [Restore]

  == Installed Forks ==
  [Fork ▶]  [Branch ▶]
  [Drive]  [Update]  [Delete]
  [Undo]   [Self‑Update]

  [Install New Fork]

  == Settings (2×2 Grid) ==
  [Enable Self‑Update]    [Auto‑Backup]
  [Show Advanced Logs]     [Backup History Limit: ◀▶]

  == Log Area ==
  [Clear Log]
  [████████████████████████████████████]

  == Footer ==
  [Help]  [About]
}

' ===========================
' 2. State Diagram
' ===========================
state Idle
state Checking
state Available
state Downloading
state Installing
state Completed

Idle --> Checking         : Click CHECK
Checking --> Available    : UpdaterState=fetch_available
Checking --> Idle         : UpdaterState=idle (no update)
Available --> Downloading : Click DOWNLOAD
Downloading --> Installing: on data ready
Installing --> Completed  : installBtn clicked
Completed --> Idle        : refreshLabels()

@enduml
